        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This should now be fixed on latest `main`. Together with added text (\"Add\", \"Change\", \"Delete\") set for quickfix entries for 'mini.diff' hunks.\r\n\r\nThe issue proved to be that `MiniDiff.export()` did not set `col` and `end_col` for entries which propagated into `col=0` and `end_col=nil` for 'mini.pick' items. Having `col=0` refused to update preview (this issue), while `end_col=nil` didn't show range highlighting. Both of them should now be present resulting in `:Pick list scope='quickfix'` preview working better.",
